BIT-07: Skip solver work whose result is known

newton_solve() computed pow(10, -numsig) on every call; compute it once.
ROS2's Jacobian evaluated the rates twice for every species, including
species that no rate expression uses, whose column is all zeros; without
full coupling, skip those columns.

Requires: none
Results: identical (every concentration, the output file and the report are unchanged)

Apply from the root of an EPANET-MSX checkout at 85a303d, after FIX-01, FIX-02 and BIT-01 to BIT-06:
    git apply --whitespace=nowarn BIT-07.patch
or use tools/build-msx.sh, which applies the series in order.

